(2)    8/   1DAAE :                     ; WITH REGARD TO THIS SOFTWARE INCLUDING ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF
(2)    9/   1DAAE :                     ; MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR
(2)   10/   1DAAE :                     ; ANY SPECIAL, DIRECT, INDIRECT, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR ANY DAMAGES
(2)   11/   1DAAE :                     ; WHATSOEVER RESULTING FROM LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, WHETHER IN AN
(2)   12/   1DAAE :                     ; ACTION OF CONTRACT, NEGLIGENCE OR OTHER TORTIOUS ACTION, ARISING OUT
(2)   13/   1DAAE :                     ; OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OR PERFORMANCE OF THIS SOFTWARE.
